      ],
      "remediation": {
        "summary": "In the Admin console, open Security → Authentication → 2-step verification. Check which setting applies to these accounts' organizational unit or groups, and turn on enforcement with a short new-user enrollment period. Tell users before the enforcement date so nobody is locked out. Prefer security keys or passkeys for administrators and for people with access to production or customer data. If people sign in to Google through another identity provider, confirm it requires a second factor for these accounts. Run scheck again to confirm that Google reports them as required."
